sysIrqBind.doc:
Definition in FP-RISC prelude (core/prelude.fpr):

```
sysIrqBind src target =
  me = myself 0;
  _ = case target == me of True -> Unit | False -> error "Sys.irqBind: an actor binds itself";
  _ = case src >= 1 of True -> Unit | False -> error "Sys.irqBind: irq out of range";
  _ = Sys.irqTarget 1;
  _ = irqAsk me 1 src;
  Unit.
```

